{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47377","headline":"同刘主簿承介建昌江泛舟作 · 吴筠","name":"同刘主簿承介建昌江泛舟作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾友从吏隐，和光心杳然。\n鸣琴正多暇，啸侣浮清川。\n风霁远澄映，昭昭涵洞天。\n坐惊衆峰转，乃觉孤舟迁。\n崖屿非一状，差池过目前。\n徘徊白日暮，月色江中鲜。\n真兴殊未已，滔滔且泝沿。\n时歌沧浪曲，或诵逍遥篇。\n酣畅迷夜久，迟迟方告旋。\n此时无相与，其旨在忘筌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}